@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

# NUTS — Nomenclature of Territorial Units for Statistics, published as SKOS
# by the EU Publications Office (EU Vocabularies, dataset "nuts~~1" on
# data.europa.eu). Reuse is governed by Commission Decision 2011/833/EU
# (COM_REUSE on the dataset record), which the EU legal notice implements as
# CC BY 4.0 (verified 2026-06-10 at
